{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1854","published":"2026-04-11T11:10:52Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:46.926661758Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-34933"],"summary":"avahi security update","details":"Avahi is a system which facilitates service discovery on a local network via the mDNS/DNS-SD protocol suite. This enables you to plug your laptop or computer into a network and instantly be able to view other people who you can chat with, find printers to print to or find files being shared.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nAvahi is a system which facilitates service discovery on a local network via the mDNS/DNS-SD protocol suite. Prior to version 0.9-rc4, any unprivileged local user can crash avahi-daemon by sending a single D-Bus method call with conflicting publish flags. This issue has been patched in version 0.9-rc4.(CVE-2026-34933)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"avahi","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/avahi&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.8-28.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["avahi-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-autoipd-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-compat-howl-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-compat-howl-devel-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-compat-libdns_sd-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-compat-libdns_sd-devel-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-debuginfo-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-debugsource-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-devel-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-dnsconfd-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-glib-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-glib-devel-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-gobject-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-gobject-devel-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-libs-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-tools-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-ui-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-ui-devel-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","avahi-ui-gtk3-0.8-28.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","av